WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.488 --> 00:00:07.753
Annie was excited, along with everyone else in her class.

2
00:00:08.894 --> 00:00:12.516
The children were getting ready to start rehearsing for their annual play.

3
00:00:13.997 --> 00:00:17.440
This year the play was The Three Billy Goats Gruff.

4
00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:20.282
Their teacher, Ms.

5
00:00:20.342 --> 00:00:25.405
Fisher, had been reading the story to them for weeks now, and they all knew it by heart.

6
00:00:27.207 --> 00:00:28.708
Everyone wanted to be in the play.

7
00:00:30.148 --> 00:00:32.349
Everyone, that is, except Henry.

8
00:00:32.369 --> 00:00:38.390
"I just want to stand in the corner and be a tree," Henry told Annie.

9
00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:41.271
"Come on, Henry!

10
00:00:41.851 --> 00:00:43.392
Being in a play will be fun!"

11
00:00:44.032 --> 00:00:44.672
Annie said.

12
00:00:46.172 --> 00:00:49.093
Ms. Fisher tried to get the children to quiet down.

13
00:00:52.034 --> 00:00:54.034
"I need everyone to listen!

14
00:00:54.535 --> 00:00:56.775
We're going to have our first rehearsal now.

15
00:00:57.955 --> 00:00:59.756
Who knows what a rehearsal is?"

16
00:01:00.948 --> 00:01:02.109
Annie raised her hand.

17
00:01:02.129 --> 00:01:05.151
"It's when we practice for the play."

18
00:01:05.171 --> 00:01:08.013
"Yes, Annie.

19
00:01:08.473 --> 00:01:15.077
This year, everyone is going to have a speaking part, so we have to practice saying our lines,"

20
00:01:15.437 --> 00:01:15.877
said Ms.

21
00:01:15.917 --> 00:01:19.739
Fisher. "Nobody will stand around as a tree.

22
00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:27.464
There are four parts: the first goat, the second goat, the third goat, and the troll.

23
00:01:28.984 --> 00:01:30.445
Everyone will share a part.

24
00:01:31.705 --> 00:01:33.566
I've already chosen who will play what."

25
00:01:35.487 --> 00:01:40.569
Someone called out, "I know what Henry is going to be—the troll!"

26
00:01:42.089 --> 00:01:44.190
All the children laughed except Annie.

27
00:01:45.691 --> 00:01:46.791
"No, I'm not!"

28
00:01:47.572 --> 00:01:50.013
yelled Henry, as he ran under a table.

29
00:01:50.033 --> 00:01:55.795
"I don't want to be in a stupid play!"

30
00:01:55.815 --> 00:02:02.402
Ms. Fisher said patiently, "Henry, if you stay under that table, you'll miss our first rehearsal.

31
00:02:03.663 --> 00:02:05.244
Then you can't be in the play.

32
00:02:05.784 --> 00:02:07.005
Don't you want to join us?"

33
00:02:08.206 --> 00:02:09.347
Henry shook his head.

34
00:02:09.367 --> 00:02:14.209
"Okay, then you will sit in the corner and watch us.

35
00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:17.712
You know where to go," said Ms.

36
00:02:17.752 --> 00:02:20.193
Fisher, pointing to a chair in the corner of the room.

37
00:02:21.614 --> 00:02:24.936
Henry sat in the chair and sadly watched the rest of the class.

38
00:02:26.184 --> 00:02:28.465
Annie was chosen to be one of the first goats.

39
00:02:29.846 --> 00:02:31.527
She wanted to make Henry feel better.

40
00:02:32.468 --> 00:02:33.788
She tried smiling at him.

41
00:02:34.349 --> 00:02:35.509
But he didn't look at her.

42
00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:39.972
Later, during lunch, Annie tried talking to Henry.

43
00:02:41.073 --> 00:02:43.074
But he ignored her for the rest of the day.

44
00:02:44.394 --> 00:02:47.756
He didn't care if he had to sit in the corner during every rehearsal.

45
00:02:48.297 --> 00:02:50.158
He would not be in the play.

46
00:02:51.479 --> 00:02:53.820
The next day, the class rehearsed again.

47
00:02:55.232 --> 00:03:01.355
The goats were practicing walking over the bridge while saying, "Trip, trap, trip, trap."

48
00:03:02.716 --> 00:03:03.697
But Ms.

49
00:03:03.757 --> 00:03:05.017
Fisher wasn't pleased.

50
00:03:06.858 --> 00:03:10.460
She said, "Something is missing.

51
00:03:11.561 --> 00:03:14.002
We need to make the goats' footsteps louder.

52
00:03:15.243 --> 00:03:18.225
Each goat should sound heavier than the one before it.

53
00:03:19.385 --> 00:03:21.526
We'll have to think of something."

54
00:03:23.768 --> 00:03:28.477
Meanwhile, Annie was trying to think of how to make Henry interested in the play.

55
00:03:29.898 --> 00:03:31.758
The kids had music class next.

56
00:03:32.738 --> 00:03:34.919
They were all allowed to choose their instruments.

57
00:03:36.699 --> 00:03:38.200
Annie chose the tambourine.

58
00:03:38.820 --> 00:03:40.160
Henry chose the drum.

59
00:03:41.341 --> 00:03:43.801
They paraded around the room with their instruments.

60
00:03:45.562 --> 00:03:47.202
First they played softly.

61
00:03:48.443 --> 00:03:52.404
Then they played loud, louder, and loudest of all.

62
00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:59.021
When the class was over, the music teacher praised everyone, especially Henry.

63
00:03:59.041 --> 00:04:01.782
"Wonderful, Henry!

64
00:04:02.422 --> 00:04:06.223
You did a great job playing the drum louder and louder each time."

65
00:04:07.844 --> 00:04:09.944
Suddenly, Annie had an idea!

66
00:04:10.504 --> 00:04:11.385
She hurried to Ms.

67
00:04:11.445 --> 00:04:12.385
Fisher to tell her.

68
00:04:13.105 --> 00:04:14.566
The teacher liked the idea.

69
00:04:15.826 --> 00:04:16.626
Then Ms.

70
00:04:16.666 --> 00:04:22.888
Fisher walked over to Henry and said, "I heard you played the drum very well today, Henry—is that

71
00:04:22.948 --> 00:04:27.017
right?" Henry smiled with pride.

72
00:04:27.037 --> 00:04:30.518
"Would you like to play the drum during the play?

73
00:04:31.858 --> 00:04:35.459
We need someone to make the sound of goats walking over the bridge."

74
00:04:36.939 --> 00:04:39.140
Henry nodded his head excitedly.

75
00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:44.482
"It's not a speaking part," Ms.

76
00:04:44.502 --> 00:04:47.983
Fisher said, "but we would be happy if you joined us."

77
00:04:50.163 --> 00:04:52.664
"We're going to be in the play together!"

78
00:04:53.468 --> 00:04:55.310
Annie shouted as she hugged Henry.

79
00:04:57.012 --> 00:04:58.974
The play was a big success.

80
00:05:00.255 --> 00:05:04.359
At the final curtain call, all the children lined up and bowed.

81
00:05:05.721 --> 00:05:09.164
Henry and Annie looked at each other and smiled.

82
00:05:10.486 --> 00:05:12.207
Annie gave Henry the thumbs-up.

83
00:05:13.729 --> 00:05:15.230
"I knew you could do it!"

84
00:05:15.891 --> 00:05:16.532
she whispered.
